title: 'pallet-session: default body for `MigrateDisabledValidators::peek_disabled`'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `MigrateDisabledValidators::peek_disabled` now has a default body that returns an empty list.
    An implementor built without its own `try-runtime` feature, such as `pallet-staking` when only
    `pallet-session/try-runtime` is enabled, no longer fails to compile with E0046.
crates:
- name: pallet-session
  bump: patch
